  <id>urbanduplicati</id>
  <name>Dupli</name>
  <summary>Find and remove duplicate photos and videos</summary>
  <description><![CDATA[Dupli scans your Nextcloud media library and finds duplicate photos and videos using perceptual hashing algorithms.

Features:
- Perceptual hash detection (dHash, pHash, wHash)
- Bulk delete duplicates with one click
- Filename filter by glob pattern (e.g. IMG*, *.jpg)
- Folder protection rules
- Keep-from-folder option for protected duplicates
- Select all groups across pages
- Storage savings preview before deletion
- Audit log with CSV export
- Side-by-side thumbnail preview
  ]]></description>
